              "text": "బలహీనపడు — balahīnapaḍu — \"to lose strength; to weaken\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "తీరం దాటిన తరువాత తుపాను బలహీనపడింది. tīraṁ dāṭina taruvāta tupānu balahīnapaḍindi. After crossing the coast the storm weakened."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): బలహీనపడ్డాను, balahīnapaḍḍānu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "బలం, strength, + హీన, lacking, + పడు. Said of storms, of the body and of a currency."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "బలహీనపడు (balahīnapaḍu) is a Telugu verb built from Sanskrit bala, \"strength\", and hīna, \"lacking, deprived of\" (Monier-Williams), with the native పడు, \"to undergo\" (DEDR 3853)."
            }
